WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.090 --> 00:00:01.680
- So wait, since you're
the baby of the family,

00:00:01.680 --> 00:00:02.820
did your brothers or sisters,

00:00:02.820 --> 00:00:03.930
did they give you a hard time?

00:00:03.930 --> 00:00:05.600
I'm the baby in my family.

00:00:05.600 --> 00:00:06.810
- I'm the baby,

00:00:06.810 --> 00:00:10.380
like your baby in your
family could get like love.

00:00:10.380 --> 00:00:12.060
- No, we...

00:00:12.060 --> 00:00:14.070
- I'm the baby of 10 comedians,

00:00:14.070 --> 00:00:17.550
so you have to understand
I'm the butt of every joke.

00:00:17.550 --> 00:00:20.010
- Yeah, that was my life!

00:00:20.010 --> 00:00:22.680
- Every sister almost
killed me in some way.

00:00:22.680 --> 00:00:24.060
- Okay, no, wait, what, no, yeah.

00:00:24.060 --> 00:00:25.200
- My sister, Devonne,

00:00:25.200 --> 00:00:27.420
I accidentally ate a vitamin E pill

00:00:27.420 --> 00:00:29.850
and she said, "Marlon, you're gonna die."

00:00:29.850 --> 00:00:30.683
I said, "what?"

00:00:30.683 --> 00:00:32.340
She goes, "so the only
way you could fix it,

00:00:32.340 --> 00:00:34.860
you gotta drink nine
glasses of cold water,

00:00:34.860 --> 00:00:38.490
eight glasses of warm water,
and six glasses of hot water."

00:00:38.490 --> 00:00:42.240
Girl, I almost drowned. (laughs)

00:00:42.240 --> 00:00:45.720
I sitting in the bed with
water spilling out my mouth.

00:00:45.720 --> 00:00:47.220
My belly was filled up to here.

00:00:47.220 --> 00:00:49.650
She goes, "don't tell mama."

00:00:49.650 --> 00:00:50.949
I was like...

00:00:50.949 --> 00:00:52.020
- Oh my gosh!

00:00:52.020 --> 00:00:53.730
- And then she bribed me with a Tic Tac,

00:00:53.730 --> 00:00:54.960
and put that in my mouth

00:00:54.960 --> 00:00:57.330
with the water drooling out of my mouth.

00:00:57.330 --> 00:00:59.580
I didn't tell mama, but I did almost die.

00:00:59.580 --> 00:01:00.990
That was interesting.

00:01:00.990 --> 00:01:01.944
- Okay, that was a little more intense.

00:01:01.944 --> 00:01:04.500
One of my siblings gave me
chocolate covered dog food

00:01:04.500 --> 00:01:05.901
and said it was candy.

00:01:05.901 --> 00:01:07.050
(audience laughs)

00:01:07.050 --> 00:01:08.340
- That's not bad.

00:01:08.340 --> 00:01:10.352
- Honestly, it tasted like chocolate, so.

00:01:10.352 --> 00:01:11.430
(laughs)

00:01:11.430 --> 00:01:13.980
- Every last sibling has probably

00:01:13.980 --> 00:01:16.350
farted on me from the ages of one.

00:01:16.350 --> 00:01:18.660
- Did they do the spit thing,
where they suck it back up?

00:01:18.660 --> 00:01:20.970
They pin you down, they spit,
and then they suck it back up?

00:01:20.970 --> 00:01:21.990
- No, that's gross!

00:01:21.990 --> 00:01:23.752
- Exactly!

00:01:23.752 --> 00:01:26.220
I'm telling you, do you know that I have

00:01:26.220 --> 00:01:28.333
a complete phobia of saliva to this day?

00:01:28.333 --> 00:01:29.300
- You need a new family!

00:01:29.300 --> 00:01:30.930
- No, he used to pin me down,

00:01:30.930 --> 00:01:32.580
and he'd do that spit thing,
and he'd suck it back up.

00:01:32.580 --> 00:01:33.413
That happened to anybody?

00:01:33.413 --> 00:01:34.950
Thank you!
(audience laughs)

00:01:34.950 --> 00:01:36.120
Everyone's family is messed up.

00:01:36.120 --> 00:01:37.170
Not just mine, Marlon!

00:01:37.170 --> 00:01:38.970
- No, but listen, here's
the beauty, right?

00:01:38.970 --> 00:01:39.803
- [Kelly] Yeah?

00:01:39.803 --> 00:01:44.071
- I used to tell my brothers
"one day you will be old."

00:01:44.071 --> 00:01:45.097
(Kelly laughs)

00:01:45.097 --> 00:01:48.652
"And when you on that deathbed,
I'm farting in your mouth."

00:01:48.652 --> 00:01:50.351
(Kelly laughs)
(audience laughs)

00:01:50.351 --> 00:01:52.622
- I am Dutch ovening you like...

00:01:52.622 --> 00:01:53.822
(laughs) That's amazing.

